    "notes": "Rocky Bay Beach between golfcourse and Shek-O main beach. Requires inspection before your first landing. Take the path between the Shek O bus stop (there is only one) and the golf course. You'll walk past a basketball court to get there. If you end up at Ben's Backstreet Surf Bar (good place for after-flight drinks!) you are on the right beach, but landing area is at north end of this beach. \r\n\r\nLanding on the Shek O main beach or on the golf course is PROHIBITED unless it's an emergency situation. \r\n\r\nAgain - *mandatory* - see the excellent photos, videos and site briefing at: http://hkpa.net/index.php/main-menu/flying-information/site-guide?id=39",
